                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Use Case Driver (POC):</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_22860-10857959-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      Sonya Wade
  </td>
            </tr>
                                <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Business Sponsor:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_20710-10857959-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      Kari Hayes
  </td>
            </tr>
                                <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>AI Capabilities / Usage:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_28984-10857959-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      <p>The proposed solution leverages <b>Generative AI capabilities within Pega (Coach AI and Knowledge/Content Buddy)</b> to enhance agent productivity and customer interactions.</p>

<p>Generative AI is used to:</p>

<ul>
	<li><b>Generate real-time responses</b> to agent queries using natural language, grounded in enterprise knowledge sources</li>
	<li><b>Summarize customer interactions, cases, and historical data</b> to provide quick context and reduce manual effort</li>
	<li><b>Recommend relevant knowledge articles and next-best actions</b> during live member calls</li>
	<li><b>Draft responses and assist with communication</b>, improving consistency and reducing response time</li>
	<li><b>Automate routine tasks</b> such as case summaries, follow-ups, and documentation</li>
</ul>

  </td>
            </tr>
                                <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>MVP Success Criteria / Expected Benefit:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_20663-10857959-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      <h3><a name="SuccessCriteria%28Pilot%2FMVPPhase%29"></a><b>Success Criteria (Pilot / MVP Phase)</b></h3>

<ul>
	<li><b>Reduction in Average Handle Time (AHT)</b> for member calls through faster information retrieval</li>
	<li><b>Improved First Call Resolution (FCR)</b> by enabling agents with real-time, accurate guidance</li>
	<li><b>Reduction in agent research time</b> for knowledge articles and process lookups</li>
	<li><b>Positive pilot user feedback</b> on usability, relevance, and accuracy of AI recommendations</li>
	<li><b>Adoption rate by pilot agents</b> using Coach AI and Content Buddy during live interactions</li>
	<li><b>Accuracy and relevance of AI-generated responses</b> based on enterprise knowledge sources</li>
	<li><b>Compliance adherence</b> with no security or data access violations observed</li>
</ul>

  </td>
            </tr>
                                <tr>
                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Intended Users &amp; Delivery Timing:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_20658-10857959-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      <p>By end of Q3, 2026</p>
  </td>
            </tr>
