    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>This user story focuses on implementing <b>Pega Knowledge (Content Buddy)</b> and <b>Coach AI</b> capabilities within <b>Shield Advisor (Pega)</b> to improve agent efficiency and customer experience.</p>

<p>The solution will enable:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Real-time agent guidance using natural language responses during member calls</li>
	<li>Intelligent retrieval of knowledge articles and process information</li>
	<li>Faster navigation of information lookup tools and reduced manual research effort</li>
</ul>


<p>This aligns with the business goal of improving agent productivity, reducing training time, and enhancing member interaction quality.</p>

<h3><a name="ProblemStatement"></a><b>Problem Statement</b></h3>

<p>Agents currently face delays in:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Training for sentiment-based interactions</li>
	<li>Navigating knowledge articles</li>
	<li>Researching member inquiries</li>
	<li>Accessing benefit quoting and lookup tools</li>
</ul>


<p>This impacts operational efficiency and multiple business metrics.</p>

<h3><a name="BusinessValue%2FExpectedOutcomes"></a><b>Business Value / Expected Outcomes</b></h3>

<ul>
	<li>Reduced average handle time (AHT)</li>
	<li>Improved first call resolution (FCR)</li>
	<li>Faster agent onboarding and training</li>
	<li>Enhanced customer experience through real-time assistance</li>
	<li>Reduced manual effort for information lookup</li>
</ul>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

