        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-7441573"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://blueshieldca.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Aabf20bfc-ead7-40ab-96e9-8412d17fa0bc" class="user-hover" rel="712020:abf20bfc-ead7-40ab-96e9-8412d17fa0bc" data-account-id="712020:abf20bfc-ead7-40ab-96e9-8412d17fa0bc" accountid="712020:abf20bfc-ead7-40ab-96e9-8412d17fa0bc" rel="noreferrer">Delia Johnson</a> Knowledge and Coach AI are not interacting with the member directly.  The CSR is interacting with Knowledge Buddy and Coach, so there is always a human in the loop.</p>
        </td></tr>
