        <tr id="comment-body-7441596"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>The AI tool use case and associated functionality as presented during the review process, are considered acceptable. This is not approval of the software or the vendor.  Changes to data types, integrations, users, model behavior, or functionality require re-review.  Compliance with documented safeguards is required.  Due to the associated level, risk will require mitigation controls as presented by Risk review.</p>
        </td></tr>
