        <tr id="comment-body-7554707"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>Stellarus AI Governance has completed the assessment on 09/02/2026. This use case request is now <b>approved for testing purposes in a test environment</b>.</p>

<p><b>Next steps:</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>Upload your testing results</li>
	<li>Update the ticket with your production plan</li>
</ul>


<p>Once those items are submitted, the committee will review everything offline and confirm readiness for production approval.</p>
        </td></tr>
